    "description": "Normalized [0,1] BodyFrame landmark space, origin top-left, front-camera-mirrored (the wearer's own left sits at the LOWER u). Identical convention to GarmentControlPoint (u,v).",
    "origin": "top-left",
    "range": [
      0.0,
      1.0
    ],
    "mirrored": true
  },
  "provenance": "Every case is a named perturbation of the research fixture generator's own base standing pose (kscan-live-vto/packages/evaluation/src/syntheticFixtures.ts, generateCenteredStandingSequence @ 266ab1a), already re-typed in LiveVtoBodyFrame.neutral(). Perturbations are geometric transforms of that base (rotation about the torso centre, axis scaling, landmark removal), not hand-authored coordinates.",
  "absentLandmarkEncoding": "null",
  "nonFiniteEncoding": "the strings \"NaN\", \"Infinity\", \"-Infinity\" -- JSON has no literal for them, and a golden set that could not express them could not test the finite-ness guards.",
